      "guid": "spark.hiddenhiraigi.immersiveraidtime",
      "name": "ImmersiveRaidTime",
      "slug": "immersiveraidtime",
      "teaser": "Sync your in-game time with reality and custom timezone.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/8WgzOYjPpmDesHrIpRY9VJDx2Cf8ZJW0ufpxZTXq.png",
      "downloads": 2790,
      "favourites_count": 27,
      "description": "<h1>Project Spark · Immersive Raid Time</h1>\n<p>Sync your in-game time with reality.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/HiddenCirno/ImmersiveRaidTime/blob/main/preview_1.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">See preview here</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/HiddenCirno/ImmersiveRaidTime/blob/main/preview_2.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">See preview here</a></p>\n<p><strong>What could it do?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Syncs your raid time completely with real-world time, with options to freely adjust your timezone and toggle Daylight Saving Time (DST).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enables “Immersive Mode,” which replaces the top-right raid countdown timer with a real-world clock. The raid duration becomes infinite, and the MIA (Missing In Action) mechanic is completely disabled.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Provides secondary QOL (Quality of Life) improvements: single-pressing the ‘O’ key will now also display the real-world time on the HUD indicator (this specific real-time display is unaffected by custom timezone settings).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to install?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>ownload the latest release from the Releases section on the right. Extract the archive and simply drop the <code>BepInEx</code> folder into your game’s root directory, overwriting if necessary.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Compatibility?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fika:</strong> Fully compatible. I haven’t encountered any issues during my actual testing.</li>\n<li><strong>Fika.Co-op:</strong> Unsure/Untested.</li>\n<li><strong>Fika.Headless:</strong> Unsure/Untested. Same as above.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>I Need Translate!</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can find language file in <code>YourGamePath/BepInEx/plugins/ImmersiveRaidTime/locales</code>, create your language’s file and give a pull request for mod’s repo,  i will accept it and add in next release, you can also share your language file for other peoples, I don’t mind.</li>\n<li>In the language file, <code>Language</code> mean how your lang will display in F12 Menu(you can find default lang  <code>English</code> and <code>简体中文</code>, if you create a new language file, make sure to change it(like <code>日本語</code>).</li>\n</ul>\n",
